# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so nothing gitignored comes along by default.
# Without this file a parallel lane starts with no environment at all: the API
# cannot reach Neon, the web app has no Clerk keys, and Playwright has no test
# accounts to sign in with. Uses .gitignore syntax; only files that match AND
# are gitignored are copied, so tracked files are never duplicated.

.env
.env.local
.env.e2e.local

# Signed-in Playwright storage state, one file per role. Agents never type a
# password (`.claude/rules/e2e-auth.md`); they load these as `storageState`.
# Without them a lane's browser verification starts signed out and every
# authenticated flow fails, which is indistinguishable from the ticket's own
# change breaking. Shared across lanes on purpose: the file is a Clerk session
# for a role, while the data each lane sees lives in that lane's own database.
.auth/

# Neon CLI/integration local state — without it the lane re-prompts for a branch.
.neon
